                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                        "entry_id": "97c0091e-71f4-3d0a-8d00-625c4ab19ce3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ignore the usual channels or procedures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77a5bbc8-ae66-4faf-8f4a-e9f601cfc7db",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "A team of researchers in the United States and United Kingdom say they have created the world’s first synthetic human embryo-like structures from stem cells, bypassing the need for eggs and sperm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25e6f837-bcc6-4304-88e2-311141c2af88",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "More to theyr proper Elements inaugurated none, / Than ſhee to hers by-paſſed, he to his poſſeſſed Throne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c01bf165-46ad-470c-b8f9-db480c5511b6",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "Another force, also from the east, has by-passed Peiping and is striking southward. It apparently intends to swing eastward to form a junction, which probably will be effected near Langfang, on the railroad 30 miles southeast of Peiping."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "439e72d2-0148-4575-99ef-ef79a4684557",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "I never got seated. 1 stood in the entrance half an hour, bypassed again and again by a maitre d’hotel who had clearly been through all this many times before. Walking to a seat, I realized, would gain me nothing. No waiter would take my order."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38c4cf39-b24c-453b-ad49-35aa3e064c9a",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "Datacasting bypasses the wired, terrestrial Internet and is a cheaper way to distribute software than pressing and mailing CDs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27530a2d-c566-4155-8751-b92313a7795f",
                                                "sense_id": "8e8ab514-d93c-3f1c-9a9b-f807ae9bc867",
                                                "text": "Thanks to Brexit, many ferry companies now run direct from Ireland to the EU mainland, bypassing UK ports such as Fishguard, with an impact on traffic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
